          <persName type="preferred">Rāmānanda Yati</persName>
          <persName type="variant">Rāmānanda Sarasvatī</persName>
          <persName type="variant">Rāmabhadrānanda Sarasvatī</persName>
          <trait type="student" key="p_27">
            <label>Kṛṣṇānanda Sarasvatī</label>
          </trait>
          <birth when="1670">c. 1670</birth>
          <note>He copied Kṛṣṇānanda Sarasvatī's Siddhāntasiddhāñjana in 1670</note>
          <note>He is different from another Rāmānanda Sarasvatī, the author of a subcommentary on Śaṅkara's Brahmasūtrabhāṣya called Ratnaprabhā and a treatise aligned with the Vivaraṇa interpretation of the Brahmasūtras titled Vivaraṇopanyāsa (see Duquette, forthcoming)</note>
